  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object oscillating with simple harmonic motion (SHM) takes <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> seconds to complete one full oscillation. The potential energy of the object at the maximum displacement positions is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>. How long does it take for the object to complete one full oscillation and what is the potential energy of the object at the maximum displacement positions when the amplitude of the oscillations is increased by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\"></span> %?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Time taken by the object to complete one full oscillation</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Potential energy of the object at the maximum displacement positions</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td><strong>A.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2t\"></span></td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9E}{4}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td><strong>B.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span></td>\n<td>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{9E}{4}\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td><strong>C.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2t\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4E\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td><strong>D.</strong></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4E\"></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
